{"words": [{"text": "يُوصِيكُمُ", "translation": "Instructs you"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهُ", "translation": "Allah"}, {"text": "فِىٓ", "translation": "concerning"}, {"text": "أَوْلَـٰدِكُمْ ۖ", "translation": "your children "}, {"text": "لِلذَّكَرِ", "translation": "for the male"}, {"text": "مِثْلُ", "translation": "like"}, {"text": "حَظِّ", "translation": "(the) portion"}, {"text": "ٱلْأُنثَيَيْنِ ۚ", "translation": "(of) two females"}, {"text": "فَإِن", "translation": "But if"}, {"text": "كُنَّ", "translation": "there are"}, {"text": "نِسَآءًۭ", "translation": "(only) women"}, {"text": "فَوْقَ", "translation": "more (than)"}, {"text": "ٱثْنَتَيْنِ", "translation": "two"}, {"text": "فَلَهُنَّ", "translation": "then for them"}, {"text": "ثُلُثَا", "translation": "two thirds"}, {"text": "مَا", "translation": "(of) what"}, {"text": "تَرَكَ ۖ", "translation": "he left"}, {"text": "وَإِن", "translation": "And if"}, {"text": "كَانَتْ", "translation": "(there) is"}, {"text": "وَٰحِدَةًۭ", "translation": "(only) one"}, {"text": "فَلَهَا", "translation": "then for her"}, {"text": "ٱلنِّصْفُ ۚ", "translation": "(is) half"}, {"text": "وَلِأَبَوَيْهِ", "translation": "And for his parents"}, {"text": "لِكُلِّ", "translation": "for each"}, {"text": "وَٰحِدٍۢ", "translation": "one"}, {"text": "مِّنْهُمَا", "translation": "of them"}, {"text": "ٱلسُّدُسُ", "translation": "a sixth"}, {"text": "مِمَّا", "translation": "of what"}, {"text": "تَرَكَ", "translation": "(is) left"}, {"text": "إِن", "translation": "if"}, {"text": "كَانَ", "translation": "is"}, {"text": "لَهُۥ", "translation": "for him"}, {"text": "وَلَدٌۭ ۚ", "translation": "a child"}, {"text": "فَإِن", "translation": "But if"}, {"text": "لَّمْ", "translation": "not"}, {"text": "يَكُن", "translation": "is"}, {"text": "لَّهُۥ", "translation": "for him"}, {"text": "وَلَدٌۭ", "translation": "any child"}, {"text": "وَوَرِثَهُۥٓ", "translation": "and inherit[ed] him"}, {"text": "أَبَوَاهُ", "translation": "his parents"}, {"text": "فَلِأُمِّهِ", "translation": "then for his mother"}, {"text": "ٱلثُّلُثُ ۚ", "translation": "(is) one third"}, {"text": "فَإِن", "translation": "And if"}, {"text": "كَانَ", "translation": "are"}, {"text": "لَهُۥٓ", "translation": "for him"}, {"text": "إِخْوَةٌۭ", "translation": "brothers and sisters"}, {"text": "فَلِأُمِّهِ", "translation": "then for his mother"}, {"text": "ٱلسُّدُسُ ۚ", "translation": "(is) the sixth"}, {"text": "مِنۢ", "translation": "from"}, {"text": "بَعْدِ", "translation": "after"}, {"text": "وَصِيَّةٍۢ", "translation": "any will"}, {"text": "يُوصِى", "translation": "he has made"}, {"text": "بِهَآ", "translation": "[of which]"}, {"text": "أَوْ", "translation": "or"}, {"text": "دَيْنٍ ۗ", "translation": "any debt"}, {"text": "ءَابَآؤُكُمْ", "translation": "Your parents"}, {"text": "وَأَبْنَآؤُكُمْ", "translation": "and your children "}, {"text": "لَا", "translation": "not"}, {"text": "تَدْرُونَ", "translation": "you know"}, {"text": "أَيُّهُمْ", "translation": "which of them"}, {"text": "أَقْرَبُ", "translation": "(is) nearer"}, {"text": "لَكُمْ", "translation": "to you"}, {"text": "نَفْعًۭا ۚ", "translation": "(in) benefit"}, {"text": "فَرِيضَةًۭ", "translation": "An obligation"}, {"text": "مِّنَ", "translation": "from"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهِ ۗ", "translation": "Allah"}, {"text": "إِنَّ", "translation": "Indeed"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهَ", "translation": "Allah"}, {"text": "كَانَ", "translation": "is"}, {"text": "عَلِيمًا", "translation": "All-Knowing"}, {"text": "حَكِيمًۭا", "translation": "All-Wise"}], "sahih": "Allāh instructs you concerning your children [i.e., their portions of inheritance]: for the male, what is equal to the share of two females. But if there are [only] daughters, two or more, for them is two thirds of one's estate.1 And if there is only one, for her is half. And for one's parents, to each one of them is a sixth of his estate if he left children. But if he had no children and the parents [alone] inherit from him, then for his mother is one third. And if he had brothers [and/or sisters], for his mother is a sixth,2 after any bequest he [may have] made or debt.3 Your parents or your children - you know not which of them are nearest to you in benefit. [These shares are] an obligation [imposed] by Allāh. Indeed, Allāh is ever Knowing and Wise."}